{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>對於喜愛烹飪的人來說，尋找合適的菜譜往往耗時費力。Recipe Manager 4 Pro 是一款專為美食愛好者設計的菜譜管理應用，提供數千道精美菜餚的詳細步驟，無論你是廚房新手還是烹飪高手，都能透過簡潔直觀的介面輕鬆找到靈感。目前這款應用正在限時免費，原價 US $0.99，千萬不要錯過。</p>\n\n<h2>核心功能與使用體驗</h2>\n<p>這款應用的亮點在於智能分類與快速篩選。你可以根據早餐、午餐、晚餐或健康需求瀏覽菜餚，也可以利用時間篩選器找出 30 分鐘內能完成的食譜。每個菜譜都附有高畫質圖片與逐步教學，讓複雜的料理變得容易上手。此外，每日精選菜譜和季節性主題收藏能幫助你發掘新口味，避免重複煮食。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1320x2868bb-118-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1320x2868bb-119-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1320x2868bb-120-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1320x2868bb-121-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1320x2868bb-122-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1320x2868bb-123-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Recipe Manager 4 Pro</li>\n<li>應用類別：Food &amp; Drink</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T14:59:38.890337+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":349,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}